P70Eb9gJtcQrfGKkOsM5HuQA2rlDj_90h4Yb9lv_A&oe=6AA17196"}, {"file_name": "VideoCapture_20240911-120307.png", "id": "501013332885139", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974452_501013336218472_3493179610003760137_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qfj3Fr9TGToQ7kNvwFBc-2I&_nc_oc=Adrc0N2HIpWMkwFHaCL1VDHXPMGSoc1ZU3-VRybVYtkqMvk1o5xiHeJ2-vEbzLzO3XI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK_EQDdx6AI5diaW2P--tweDwj1AhXLHN3rS_VD0IO4oA&oe=6AA1513F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Balloon Date", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Balloon Date brings a unique and entertaining twist to the dating scene in mixed reality. Step into a vibrant virtual world where you meet potential dates on stage. Each person comes with a set of balloons that, when popped, reveal interesting facts, quirky traits, and fun surprises.\n\nKey Features:\n\nInteractive Gameplay: Pop balloons to uncover details about your potential date.\nImmersive Environment: Enjoy a lively and engaging mixed reality setting.\nDecision Making: Use the information revealed to decide if you want to date the person on stage.\nFun Surprises: Discover unexpected and amusing facts that add excitement to the game.\nSocial Interaction: Engage with virtual avatars and experience the dynamics of dating in a new way.\nWill you find your perfect match or move on to the next candidate? Dive into the world of Balloon Date and let the popping begin on Meta Quest 3!", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of dating in mixed reality with Balloon Date on Meta Quest 3. Pop balloons to reveal fun facts and decide if you want to date the person on stage. Will you find your perfect match?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/4bb472b1-1d60-4028-9663-c4b5465a3f62", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Xzec Gaming", "support_website_url": null, "websit